flowchart TD
    U[Listener: genre, mood, energy] --> V[Validate input]
    V --> P[Agent plan: retrieve, verify, rank]
    C[(Fictional song catalog)] --> R[Retrieve genre or mood matches]
    P --> R
    R --> G[Verify energy gap ≤ 0.25]
    G --> S[Original weighted scorer and explanations]
    S --> X[Retrieve genre and mood notes]
    K[(Two local note indexes)] --> X
    X --> O[Recommendations and attributed context or no-match message]
    P -. optional trace .-> L[Saved decision log]
    O --> H[Human reviews or revises preferences]
    H --> U
    T[Automated reliability tests] -. check .-> V
    T -. check .-> G
    T -. check .-> S
